Scope: this license covers the original work in this repository: the scripts in
tools/, the macros and notes written for this printer, the OrcaSlicer presets,
and the documentation. Files derived from third-party sources keep their
original licenses (see "Credits and references" in README.md), in particular:

- klipper/printer.cfg and klipper/ebb_extruder.cfg started from the Voron Design
  and BIGTREETECH sample configurations
- klipper/KAMP_Settings.cfg comes from Klipper-Adaptive-Meshing-Purging (KAMP)
- firmware/candlelight/ contains a candleLight firmware build
- the calibration models used by tools/orca_calib.py are NOT included; they are
  read from the user's own OrcaSlicer installation (AGPL-3.0)
